# Darksteel Angel: "Creatures you control can't have -1/-1 counters put on them" is about its controller's creatures only. On
# turn 6 Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla attacks and Bot1's Glistener Elf, which has infect, blocks it: the Elf's 1 damage is dealt to
# the Gorilla as a -1/-1 counter, so it is a 1/1 with one on it, and the Gorilla's 2 damage kills the 1/1 Elf.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Darksteel Angel
Glistener Elf
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Guerrilla Gorilla
Mox Emerald
Forest x4
Forest x13

